<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Teste — Bitcoin DeFi · GymDiet</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/defi-test.css">
</head>
<body class="defi-page">
<div class="defi-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="defi-glow defi-glow--top" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="defi-glow defi-glow--side" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<main class="defi-container">

    <header class="defi-header">
        <div>
            <p class="defi-label">GymDiet · Teste de estilo</p>
            <h1 class="defi-heading defi-title">Treino <span class="defi-gradient-text">Ativo</span></h1>
            <p class="defi-lead">Componentes reais do GymDiet no estilo Bitcoin DeFi: métricas em painel técnico, grupos musculares como blocos, ações em pílula e campos de registro de carga.</p>
            <div class="defi-btn-row">
                <button type="button" class="defi-btn defi-btn--primary">Iniciar treino</button>
                <button type="button" class="defi-btn defi-btn--outline">Ver histórico</button>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="defi-orb">
                <span class="defi-ring defi-ring--outer"></span>
                <span class="defi-ring defi-ring--inner"></span>
                <span class="defi-orb-core"></span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </header>

    <section aria-labelledby="stats-title">
        <h2 id="stats-title" class="defi-label">Resumo</h2>
        <div class="defi-stats">
            <div>
                <p class="defi-stat-value">12</p>
                <p class="defi-stat-label">Treinos realizados</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="defi-stat-value">18</p>
                <p class="defi-stat-label">Séries (grupo)</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="defi-stat-value">80.5</p>
                <p class="defi-stat-label">Peso (kg)</p>
            </div>
            <div>
                <p class="defi-stat-value">35</p>
                <p class="defi-stat-label">Min. último treino</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="cards-title">
        <h2 id="cards-title" class="defi-heading defi-section-title">Grupos <span class="defi-gradient-text">musculares</span></h2>
        <div class="defi-cards">

            <article class="defi-card defi-card--selected">
                <span class="defi-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="defi-node" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3 class="defi-card-title">Peito / Ombro</h3>
                <p class="defi-card-text">Supino reto, crucifixo, desenvolvimento e elevação lateral.</p>
                <div class="defi-meta">
                    <span><strong>9</strong> exercícios</span>
                    <span><strong>18</strong> séries</span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="defi-btn defi-btn--primary defi-btn--block">Iniciar treino</button>
            </article>

            <article class="defi-card defi-glass">
                <span class="defi-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="defi-node" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3 class="defi-card-title">Perna</h3>
                <p class="defi-card-text">Agachamento, leg press e cadeira flexora.</p>
                <div class="defi-meta">
                    <span><strong>8</strong> exercícios</span>
                    <span><strong>16</strong> séries</span>
                </div>
                <button type="button" class="defi-btn defi-btn--outline defi-btn--block">Iniciar treino</button>
            </article>

            <article class="defi-card">
                <span class="defi-watermark" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <span class="defi-node" aria-hidden="true">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 6.5h11v11h-11z"/><path d="M2 12h2M20 12h2M12 2v2M12 20v2"/></svg>
                </span>
                <h3 class="defi-card-title">Costas</h3>
                <p class="defi-card-text">Puxada, remada curvada e serrote unilateral.</p>
                <div class="defi-meta">
                    <span><strong>8</strong> exercícios</span>
                    <span><strong>14</strong> séries</span>
                </div>
                <a href="#" class="defi-link">Ver exercícios →</a>
            </article>

        </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="form-title">
        <h2 id="form-title" class="defi-heading defi-section-title">Registro de <span class="defi-gradient-text">carga</span></h2>
        <div class="defi-form">
            <div class="defi-field">
                <label class="defi-input-label" for="f-weight">Carga usada</label>
                <input class="defi-input" id="f-weight" type="text" placeholder="ex: 20kg">
            </div>
            <div class="defi-field">
                <label class="defi-input-label" for="f-reps">Repetições</label>
                <input class="defi-input" id="f-reps" type="text" placeholder="ex: 12, 10, 8">
            </div>
            <div class="defi-field">
                <label class="defi-input-label" for="f-note">Observação</label>
                <input class="defi-input" id="f-note" type="text" placeholder="ex: senti o ombro">
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="flow-title">
        <h2 id="flow-title" class="defi-heading defi-section-title">Fluxo do <span class="defi-gradient-text">treino</span></h2>
        <ol class="defi-timeline" style="list-style:none; margin:0;">
            <li class="defi-step">
                <span class="defi-step-node">1</span>
                <h3 class="defi-step-title">Escolha o grupo do dia</h3>
                <p class="defi-step-text">Cada grupo muscular é um bloco do programa.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="defi-step">
                <span class="defi-step-node">2</span>
                <h3 class="defi-step-title">Registre carga e repetições</h3>
                <p class="defi-step-text">Cada série fica gravada no seu histórico.</p>
            </li>
            <li class="defi-step">
                <span class="defi-step-node">3</span>
                <h3 class="defi-step-title">Finalize com um comentário</h3>
                <p class="defi-step-text">O instrutor acompanha sua evolução a partir dele.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </section>

</main>
</body>
</html>
